# Input

```css
@theme   {
  --color-brand: red;
}

@theme   inline{
  --color-brand: red;
}

@theme default   inline {
  --color-brand: red;
}

@theme default inline    reference {
  --color-brand: red;
}

@theme
  reference
  inline
  default
  static {
  --color-brand: red;
}

@theme prefix(tw){
  --color-brand: red;
}

@theme static prefix(tw) {
  --color-brand: red;
}

@theme Inline UNKNOWN {
  --color-brand: red;
}

```


